Package: tsexplorer
Type: Package
Title: Exploratory, Descriptive and Diagnostic Tools for Time Series and Forecasts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Diego J.", "Pedregal", email = "diego.pedregal@uclm.es",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Ludwig", "Kanzler", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Original BDS test algorithm"))
Description: Exploratory, descriptive and diagnostic tools for univariate
    and multivariate time series (summary statistics, gaussianity tests,
    sample autocorrelation functions, information criteria, Granger
    causality, unit root and cointegration tests, heteroskedasticity and
    non-linearity tests, spectral analysis) and tools to evaluate and
    compare forecasts (accuracy measures, Diebold-Mariano, sign and Wilcoxon
    tests). Every tool is a pure function returning an object with print and
    plot methods; the graphical interfaces tooltest() and toolforecast()
    (Tcl/Tk windows or Shiny applications) give interactive access to all
    of them.
License: GPL-3
